[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_03_0010","text":"————\n之前就是在这里……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_03_0020","text":"好痛……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_03_0030","text":"……\n但是，还得继续努力才行……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_03_0032","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_03_0040","text":"……────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_03_0050","text":"……辛、辛苦了，路加小姐……！\n我往旁边挪一点吧————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_03_0060","text":"不用"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_03_0070","text":"————脚。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_03_0080","text":"你在硬撑吧。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_03_0090","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_03_0100","text":"——那样做没用的。\n只会让伤势恶化。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_03_0110","text":"……\n……啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_03_0120","text":"疼的话——————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_03_0130","text":"────…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_03_0131","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_03_0132","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_03_0140","text":"路加小姐…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_03020100_03_0150","text":"好痛————！"}]
